  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Remove the unmaintained ntlm_smb_lm_auth NTLM helper\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-21311.patch: drop src/auth/ntlm/SMB_LM and its\n       build wiring from configure.ac, configure, src/auth/ntlm/Makefile.am,\n       src/auth/ntlm/Makefile.in and src/auth/ntlm/helpers.m4\n     - debian/rules: drop SMB_LM from --enable-auth-ntlm, so\n       /usr/lib/squid/ntlm_smb_lm_auth is no longer built or shipped and NTLM\n       authentication must use an externally provided helper such as Samba\n       ntlm_auth\n     - CVE-2025-21311",
